{"id":328,"slug":"328-as-keyword-type-assertion-la-gi-khi-nao-dung","category":"TypeScript","subcategory":"Types Nhập Môn","level":"beginner","question_vi":"as keyword (type assertion) là gì? Khi nào dùng?","question_en":"What is the as keyword (type assertion)? When should you use it?","answer_vi":"`as` **ghi đè suy luận kiểu của TypeScript lúc biên dịch**, và **không kiểm tra gì lúc chạy**.\n\n```typescript\nconst canvas = document.getElementById('c') as HTMLCanvasElement\ncanvas.getContext('2d')     // TS cho phép; nếu #c không tồn tại → lỗi lúc chạy\n```\n\nHai trường hợp dùng hợp lý:\n1. **DOM** — TypeScript chỉ biết `HTMLElement`, bạn biết cụ thể hơn.\n2. **`as const`** — giữ literal type, đây là dạng assertion an toàn nhất.\n\nHai trường hợp **không nên**:\n\n```typescript\nconst user = JSON.parse(raw) as User    // lời hứa suông, không ai kiểm tra\nconst x = something as unknown as Foo   // double assertion — dấu hiệu mô hình kiểu đang sai\n```\n\nDữ liệu từ bên ngoài phải **kiểm tra khi chạy**, không assert:\n\n```typescript\nimport { z } from 'zod'\nconst UserSchema = z.object({ id: z.number(), name: z.string() })\nconst user = UserSchema.parse(JSON.parse(raw))   // sai kiểu là ném lỗi ngay\n```\n\nThay thế an toàn hơn `as` trong nhiều tình huống là **type guard**:\n\n```typescript\nfunction isUser(v: unknown): v is User {\n  return typeof v === 'object' && v !== null && 'id' in v\n}\nif (isUser(data)) data.id    // TS thu hẹp kiểu, và có kiểm tra thật\n```\n\n**Chốt:** `as` nói \"tôi biết rõ hơn trình biên dịch\". Đúng với DOM; sai với dữ liệu mạng. Số lượng `as` trong một codebase thường tỉ lệ thuận với số bug `undefined` lúc chạy","answer_en":"`as` **overrides TypeScript's inference at compile time** and **checks nothing at runtime**.\n\n```typescript\nconst canvas = document.getElementById('c') as HTMLCanvasElement\ncanvas.getContext('2d')     // TS is happy; if #c is missing this throws at runtime\n```\n\nTwo legitimate uses:\n1. **The DOM** — TypeScript only knows `HTMLElement`, you know something more specific.\n2. **`as const`** — preserving literal types; the safest form of assertion.\n\nTwo cases where it is wrong:\n\n```typescript\nconst user = JSON.parse(raw) as User    // an unchecked promise to yourself\nconst x = something as unknown as Foo   // double assertion — a sign the model is wrong\n```\n\nExternal data must be **validated at runtime**, not asserted:\n\n```typescript\nimport { z } from 'zod'\nconst UserSchema = z.object({ id: z.number(), name: z.string() })\nconst user = UserSchema.parse(JSON.parse(raw))   // wrong shape throws immediately\n```\n\nThe safer alternative to `as` in many situations is a **type guard**:\n\n```typescript\nfunction isUser(v: unknown): v is User {\n  return typeof v === 'object' && v !== null && 'id' in v\n}\nif (isUser(data)) data.id    // TS narrows, and there is a real check\n```\n\n**Takeaway:** `as` says \"I know better than the compiler\". True for the DOM; false for network data. The number of `as` casts in a codebase usually tracks the number of runtime `undefined` bugs","answer_html_vi":"<p><code>as</code> <strong>ghi đè suy luận kiểu của TypeScript lúc biên dịch</strong>, và <strong>không kiểm tra gì lúc chạy</strong>.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"const canvas = document.getElementById('c') as HTMLCanvasElement\ncanvas.getContext('2d')     // TS cho phép; nếu #c không tồn tại → lỗi lúc chạy\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> canvas = <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">document</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">getElementById</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;c&#x27;</span>) <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">as</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">HTMLCanvasElement</span>\ncanvas.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">getContext</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;2d&#x27;</span>)     <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// TS cho phép; nếu #c không tồn tại → lỗi lúc chạy</span></code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">Hai trường hợp dùng hợp lý:<br/>1. <strong>DOM</strong> — TypeScript chỉ biết <code>HTMLElement</code>, bạn biết cụ thể hơn.<br/>2. <strong><code>as const</code></strong> — giữ literal type, đây là dạng assertion an toàn nhất.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Hai trường hợp <strong>không nên</strong>:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"const user = JSON.parse(raw) as User    // lời hứa suông, không ai kiểm tra\nconst x = something as unknown as Foo   // double assertion — dấu hiệu mô hình kiểu đang sai\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> user = <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">JSON</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">parse</span>(raw) <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">as</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">User</span>    <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// lời hứa suông, không ai kiểm tra</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> x = something <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">as</span> <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">unknown</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">as</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Foo</span>   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// double assertion — dấu hiệu mô hình kiểu đang sai</span></code></pre></div><p>Dữ liệu từ bên ngoài phải <strong>kiểm tra khi chạy</strong>, không assert:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"import { z } from 'zod'\nconst UserSchema = z.object({ id: z.number(), name: z.string() })\nconst user = UserSchema.parse(JSON.parse(raw))   // sai kiểu là ném lỗi ngay\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { z } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;zod&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">UserSchema</span> = z.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">object</span>({ <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>: z.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">number</span>(), <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>: z.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">string</span>() })\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> user = <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">UserSchema</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">parse</span>(<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">JSON</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">parse</span>(raw))   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// sai kiểu là ném lỗi ngay</span></code></pre></div><p>Thay thế an toàn hơn <code>as</code> trong nhiều tình huống là <strong>type guard</strong>:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"function isUser(v: unknown): v is User {\n  return typeof v === 'object' &amp;&amp; v !== null &amp;&amp; 'id' in v\n}\nif (isUser(data)) data.id    // TS thu hẹp kiểu, và có kiểm tra thật\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">isUser</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">v</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">unknown</span></span>): v is <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">User</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">typeof</span> v === <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;object&#x27;</span> &amp;&amp; v !== <span class=\"hljs-literal\">null</span> &amp;&amp; <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;id&#x27;</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">in</span> v\n}\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">isUser</span>(data)) data.<span class=\"hljs-property\">id</span>    <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// TS thu hẹp kiểu, và có kiểm tra thật</span></code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\"><strong>Chốt:</strong> <code>as</code> nói \"tôi biết rõ hơn trình biên dịch\".</p><ul class=\"qa-points\"><li>Đúng với DOM; sai với dữ liệu mạng.</li><li>Số lượng <code>as</code> trong một codebase thường tỉ lệ thuận với số bug <code>undefined</code> lúc chạy.</li></ul>","answer_html_en":"<p><code>as</code> <strong>overrides TypeScript's inference at compile time</strong> and <strong>checks nothing at runtime</strong>.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"const canvas = document.getElementById('c') as HTMLCanvasElement\ncanvas.getContext('2d')     // TS is happy; if #c is missing this throws at runtime\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" strok