 ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">isUser</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">v</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">unknown</span></span>): v is <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">User</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">typeof</span> v === <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;object&#x27;</span> &amp;&amp; v !== <span class=\"hljs-literal\">null</span> &amp;&amp; <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;id&#x27;</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">in</span> v\n}\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">isUser</span>(data)) data.<span class=\"hljs-property\">id</span>    <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// TS narrows, and there is a real check</span></code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\"><strong>Takeaway:</strong> <code>as</code> says \"I know better than the compiler\".</p><ul class=\"qa-points\"><li>True for the DOM; false for network data.</li><li>The number of <code>as</code> casts in a codebase usually tracks the number of runtime <code>undefined</code> bugs.</li></ul>","references":[{"label":"TypeScript — Type assertions","url":"https://www.typescriptlang.org/docs/handbook/2/everyday-types.html#type-assertions"},{"label":"TypeScript — Type predicates","url":"https://www.typescriptlang.org/docs/handbook/2/narrowing.html#using-type-predicates"}],"related":[{"url":"/q/321-typescript-la-gi-va-tai-sao-nen-dung-typescript-thay-javascript","title":"TypeScript là gì và tại sao nên dùng TypeScript thay JavaScript?"},{"url":"/q/322-type-annotation-trong-typescript-la-gi","title":"Type annotation trong TypeScript là gì?"},{"url":"/q/323-any-unknown-va-never-khac-nhau-nhu-the-nao","title":"any, unknown và never khác nhau như thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/324-union-types-va-intersection-types-la-gi","title":"Union types và intersection types là gì?"},{"url":"/q/325-literal-types-trong-typescript-la-gi","title":"Literal types trong TypeScript là gì?"},{"url":"/q/327-type-narrowing-la-gi-cac-cach-narrow-type-trong-typescript","title":"Type narrowing là gì? Các cách narrow type trong TypeScript?"},{"url":"/q/329-non-null-assertion-operator-la-gi","title":"Non-null assertion operator (!) là gì?"},{"url":"/q/330-tuple-type-trong-typescript-la-gi","title":"Tuple type trong TypeScript là gì?"}]}